{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1814","published":"2026-04-03T11:10:50Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:45.822869891Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-4897"],"summary":"polkit security update","details":"polkit is a toolkit for defining and handling authorizations. It is used for allowing unprivileged processes to speak to privileged processes.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in polkit. A local user can exploit this by providing a specially crafted, excessively long input to the `polkit-agent-helper-1` setuid binary via standard input (stdin). This unbounded input can lead to an out-of-memory (OOM) condition, resulting in a Denial of Service (DoS) for the system.(CVE-2026-4897)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"polkit","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/polkit&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"123-4.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["polkit-123-4.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","polkit-debuginfo-123-4.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","polkit-debugsource-123-4.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","polkit-devel-123-4.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","polkit-libs-123-4.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["polkit-help-123-4.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm"],"src":["polkit-123-4.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["polkit-123-4.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","polkit-debuginfo-123-4.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","polkit-debugsource-123-4.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","polkit-devel-123-4.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","polkit-libs-123-4.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-1814.json"}},{"package":{"name":"polkit","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/polkit&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.116-12.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["polkit-0.116-12.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","polkit-debuginfo-0.116-12.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","polkit-debugsource-0.116-12.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm